arm64: Translate ACPI PCI resources into device-tree cells

Publish MCFG and the EFI PCI resource windows in the synthetic device tree. Default QEMU reports MCFG buses 0 through 255 and an EFI bus descriptor for bus 0. Parallels reports bus 0 in both. Require the EFI bus range to fit within MCFG and publish the entire MCFG range.

